headers {
  Cookie: {{cookie}}
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  OData V4 Web API ZAPI_PW_TST1_01_O4 (service definition ZUI_PW_TST1_01, entity set TestLines).

  Auth: browser session cookie (ABAP Trial has no Communication Arrangement apps, so Basic Auth
  with a communication user is not possible there).
  1. Open serviceUrl in the browser and log in.
  2. F12 > Network > reload > first request > Request Headers > copy the whole "Cookie" value.
  3. Paste it into the secret variable "cookie" of environment "Trial". Repeat when the session expires (401/403).

  With a Communication Arrangement: set auth mode to basic (communication user) and remove the Cookie header.
}
